      "text": "There are limited treatment options for patients with metastatic or recurrent VSCC. The current NCCN recommendations are based on clinical trials that included only a handful of patients with VSCC. Many of the existing recommendations are extrapolated from the broader squamous cell and cervical cancer guidelines. The molecular landscape of VSCC is diverse and not well understood; however, immunotherapy is a promising option for patients with advanced disease, especially in the setting of progression following prior treatment.",
